==German==

===Etymology===
''Kakao'' is in this case perhaps a euphemism for ''[[Kacke]]'' (Duden Herkunftswörterbuch 3rd ed.)

===Verb===
{{head|de|verb|head=[[durch]] [[den]] [[Kakao]] [[ziehen]]}}
# {{context|idiomatic|lang=de}} to [[pull someone's leg]], to [[make fun of]] somebody or something.
#: {{usex|Er '''zieht''' dich nur '''durch den Kakao'''.|t=He is just pulling your leg.|inline=1|lang=de}}
	 
====Conjugation====
{{de-conj-strong| zieh| zog| gezogen|h|||zög|a||durch den Kakao }}

